From: Martin Pluskal <martin@pluskal.org>
Subject: adapters: search text with the JavaScript engine

searchText() ran ripgrep's WASI build in a worker created from source
text (eval: true), whose import("ripgrep") resolves from the working
directory: a repository's node_modules/ripgrep ran inside zcode. When
the module is missing, which it always is here since nothing ships it,
the search already falls back to the JavaScript engine; use that
directly and drop the dependency.

Patch-mainline: No

